    "paragraph": "An integrated evaluation framework assessed OpenStreetMap 3D building data quality by combining 3D geometric comparisons with machine learning predictions. Researchers created an open-access national dataset of 6,551 downtown business district polygons for pre-automobile U.S. cities and towns. Another project established a scalable, rule-based framework to classify anonymous truck GPS data into four distinct stop purposes across urban and non-urban settings.",
